DO $guard$ BEGIN IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$batch01$PT114-S1-Q8$batch01$ AND q.stimulus=$batch01$Pundit: The only airline providing service for our town announced that because the service is unprofitable it will discontinue this service next year. Town officials have urged the community to use the airline’s service more frequently so that the airline will change its decision. There is no reason to comply with their recommendation, however, for just last week these same officials drove to an out-of-town conference instead of flying.$batch01$ AND q.prompt=$batch01$The pundit's reasoning is most vulnerable to criticism on the grounds that it presumes, without providing justification, that$batch01$ AND q.correct_choice=$batch01$E$batch01$) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question changed: PT114-S1-Q8'; END IF; END $guard$;
